{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Arc 0: The Failed Isekai</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441730/extras/7d6edbc0c0f546d9861fbde216b4ca15.poster.avif?t=1760887542\" width=1170 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441730/extras/7d6edbc0c0f546d9861fbde216b4ca15.webm?t=1760887542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441730/extras/7d6edbc0c0f546d9861fbde216b4ca15.mp4?t=1760887542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Welcome to the year 2027!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>Haruto Saito</strong>, a soldier of Japan\u2019s Self-Defense Forces, who has spent years fighting on distant lands in the name of his country. As with any dangerous job, it couldn\u2019t end well \u2014 one day, Haruto loses all his comrades under his command and, by a cruel twist of fate, survives alone. <br><br>Upon returning home, tormented by guilt and regret, he faces a society terrified by the aftermath of war. Unable to find his place, Haruto risks being sent to newly established rehabilitation institutions for soldiers \u2014 places that resemble psychiatric hospitals with one-way tickets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441730/extras/9c212d9c02ef52e94adee0a1282cb491.poster.avif?t=1760887542\" width=1170 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441730/extras/9c212d9c02ef52e94adee0a1282cb491.webm?t=1760887542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441730/extras/9c212d9c02ef52e94adee0a1282cb491.mp4?t=1760887542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Naturally, according to the laws of the genre \u2014 and thanks to the power of the plot engine \u2014 fate couldn\u2019t simply ignore our would-be protagonist. It throws him into a perhaps fateful encounter with a mysterious man who invites Haruto to become a teacher \u2014 or rather, a guardian \u2014 for four troubled teenagers in a new rehabilitation project called <strong>\u201cQuiet Classroom.\u201d</strong> It\u2019s an offer that gives him a chance to avoid forced admission to the institution. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441730/extras/d00a984703d4475512f68c4401c5da54.poster.avif?t=1760887542\" width=1170 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441730/extras/d00a984703d4475512f68c4401c5da54.webm?t=1760887542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441730/extras/d00a984703d4475512f68c4401c5da54.mp4?t=1760887542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, Haruto meets his future students \u2014 frankly, rather clich\u00e9 ones. Now he must decide: is he ready to take responsibility for other people\u2019s, no less tragic, lives \u2014 or does the prospect of a daily horse dose of sedatives in a mental hospital still sound more appealing? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441730/extras/2477a3c5a5bb85c4fe0069f21cac51a7.poster.avif?t=1760887542\" width=1170 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441730/extras/2477a3c5a5bb85c4fe0069f21cac51a7.webm?t=1760887542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441730/extras/2477a3c5a5bb85c4fe0069f21cac51a7.mp4?t=1760887542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Discover how this grand story begins right now in the 90-minute demo of the comedy-drama <i>Quiet Classroom</i>!</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>OVER 30 HIGH-QUALITY ANIMATED ILLUSTRATIONS</u></strong><u> </u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>FULL VOICE-OVER INCLUDING THE MAIN CHARACTER\u2019S THOUGHTS</u></strong><u> </u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>ATMOSPHERIC AND BEAUTIFUL SOUNDTRACKS</u></strong><u> </u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>A SURVIVAL MINI-GAME, A SECRET ENDING, AND, OF COURSE, A CRAZY STORY FILLED WITH DELIGHTFULLY CLICH\u00c9D ANIME-STYLE JOKES!</u></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>THEY NEED YOU. GO!</i></strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3441730?t=1760887542","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441730/4dddf5685de6f3439e4d62feb1a1ddc2c3602fe0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760887542","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441730/9f34088435160557425f04974b1ded98363aa673/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760887542","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441730/9f34088435160557425f04974b1ded98363aa673/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760887542","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id"